  (acceptance "ADR-477 Provisional marker removed, successor-spec boundary stated"))
(given task-adr-trust-model)
(given no-deps-adr-trust-model)
(normally r-ready-adr-trust-model (and task-adr-trust-model no-deps-adr-trust-model) ready-adr-trust-model)
(normally r-assign-adr-trust-model (and ready-adr-trust-model agent-claude-available) assign-adr-trust-model-claude)

(meta task-adr-merkle-sync
