(given task-input-grammars)
(given no-deps-input-grammars)
(normally r-ready-input-grammars (and task-input-grammars no-deps-input-grammars) ready-input-grammars)
(normally r-assign-input-grammars (and ready-input-grammars agent-claude-available) assign-input-grammars-claude)

(meta task-perf-budget
